the creature lurking inside.\n- \ud83c\udf31 Grab a seed and run for the exit in a new escape minigame.\n- \ud83d\udc7b Dress up with new Halloween cosmetics.\n- \ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f Discover new seeds every week throughout the Halloween event.\n\nGo in for the seed. Run for your life!\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf31 Welcome to Bwah - Grow a Garden in VR \ud83c\udf31\nGrow plants, sell for profit, and build your dream garden! Hunt rare seeds, unlock wild mutations, and flex your ultimate garden. Stay tuned for weekly updates!\n\n**\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e How to Play**\n- Buy a seed and grab it\n- Place it in your garden\n- Wait and watch it grow\n- Harvest and earn BIG\n\nRemember, your garden literally grows while you\u2019re offline! \u2b50\ufe0f\n\n", "short_description": "\n# \ud83c\udf31 Welcome to Bwah - Grow a Garden in VR \ud83c\udf31\nGrow plants, sell for profit, and build your dream garden! Hunt rare seeds, unlock wild mutations, and flex your ultimate garden. Stay tuned for weekly updates!\n\n**\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e How to Play**\n- Buy a seed and grab it\n- Place it in your garden\n- Wait and watch it grow\n- Harvest and earn BIG\n\nRemember, your garden literally grows while you\u2019re offline! \u2b50\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/bwah/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ENVER", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/bwah/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_de